description:
The Bank of England has a requirement for: 
•	Supply of approximately 5,000 additional stillage cages picture below) for delivery up to 2031, as per the Bank's specifications;  
•	maintenance of the Bank's existing, and newly purchased,  cage estate; 
•	the provision of storage services for surplus cages from the Bank of England Debden site; and  
•	sustainable disposal of cages that are damaged beyond economic repair. 
The cages are essential to provide secure storage and enable transportation
